    "text": "wcyb.com\nwebsite\nBristol\nNASCAR driver Ryan Blaney gets surprise pep talk from 4-year-old nephew at Bristol race\nBy Heather Williams,\n1 days agoBRISTOL, Tenn. (WCYB) — NASCAR driver Ryan Blaney received an unexpected boost during this weekend's race at Bristol from an unlikely source: his 4-year-old nephew, Bodhi. Bodhi became the breakout star of the event when he managed to find a scanner on Blaney's bus and jumped on the team radio to offer his uncle some encouragement. \"Hey Uncle Ryan, win this race. Win this race,\" Bodhi said.",
